    ? '30 to 34 words (English averages about 6 characters per word including the space, so 32 words lands near 195)'
    : language === 'Hindi'
    ? '35 to 40 words (Roman-transliterated Hindi averages about 5 characters per word including the space, so 38 words lands near 195)'
