    }
  ]
}

No extra keys. No nested objects inside a scene. Escape all quotes properly. No trailing commas.

===============================================================
FINAL PRE-SUBMISSION AUDIT - PERFORM IT, DO NOT ASSUME IT
===============================================================
Count 1. Scene 1 voiceoverText character count: is it 190 to 200
Count 2. Scene 2 voiceoverText character count: is it 190 to 200
Count 3. Scene 3 voiceoverText character count: is it 190 to 200
Count 4. Scene 4 voiceoverText character count: is it 190 to 200
Count 5. Scene 5 voiceoverText character count: is it 190 to 200
