Scene 2 - CONTEXT (intensity 5): now that they are hooked, give the one piece of context that makes the stakes real. Exactly one. This is the only place where a small dip in intensity is allowed, and it must still carry an unanswered question forward.
Scene 3 - ESCALATION (intensity 7): the situation gets measurably worse, stranger, or larger. Something changes. This scene must contain a turn, not a restatement.
Scene 4 - PEAK (intensity 10): the reveal, the collapse, the answer, the impact. The highest point of the entire video. Everything before this exists to earn it.
