${identity}

=== THE CURRENT 5 SCENES - CHARACTER COUNTS ARE CODE-MEASURED AND EXACT ===
${block}

=== DO THIS ===
1. Read the instruction and the scope lock. Decide which scenes genuinely need work. Leave the rest alone.
2. For each scene you touch, rewrite only the permitted field and include only that field in your output.
3. Any voiceoverText you write must land at 190 to 200 characters. Count it in chunks. Re-count after every edit.
4. Any videoPrompt you write must be pure English, 700 to 1100 characters, open with the style specification above, carry the identity lock verbatim, hold one action and one camera move, and end with the exact technical tail sentence.
5. Put the integers of the scenes you changed in changedScenes.
6. Return the JSON object only.`;
})() }}

